  "transcript": {
    "text": "Let us talk about young people and work. Many of us finished school and have been looking for a job for more than a year. Some are doing casual labor, some are selling goods by the roadside, and some have simply stopped looking. Employers ask for experience, but nobody will give us the first chance. We would like to hear what is working for you. Has anyone found a training program that led to real work? What should local leaders do to open the door for young people?",
    "language": "English",
